  "releaseNotes": "Design check: the numbers behind the finding codes (\"ClassName:number\") are now private constants of each issuing class instead of a nested public \"Codes\" class. The codes themselves, and the SuppressedDesignChecks / \"// suppress:\" values that reference them, are unchanged. The nested classes were never meant as public API; code that referenced them (e.g. TextFieldDesign.Codes.AutoTabRequiresMaxLength) no longer compiles - use the code string reported by the design check instead.",
